  "content": {
    "title": " How many Oscars does Emma Stone have?  | Britannica",
    "text": "Emma Stone has won two Academy Awards , both for best actress: La La Land (2016) and Poor Things (2023). In addition, she has three other Oscar nominations for acting: Birdman or (The Unexpected Virtue of Ignorance) (2014), The Favourite (2018), and Bugonia (2025). As a producer, Stone also received Academy Award nods when Poor Things and Bugonia were nominated for best picture. With her Bugonia nods, Stone, who was 37 years old at the time, became the youngest woman to have seven Oscar nominations; the record was previously held by Meryl Streep .",
